1-06T17:37:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9303296804428101,"text_excerpt":"This starbucks is right by my place and while it lasts, it has been an essential establishment for me. Unfortunately this location is closing very soon due to Covid-19 impact I assume. I really enjoyed chitchatting with the employees there as they were the best seriously. I have never had a single bad experience at this location. Special thanks to Josh - he truly was the best. I am going to miss you all so much when you vacate."},{"business_id":"RfiyYH8ZEpHflMI9ZMJNGw","review_id":"mY1hqGQEpOnhthfVNFykow","date":"2019-11-27T12:13:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9138758778572083,"text_excerpt":"Nice new location downtown. Quite early morning,. The workers were helpful when explaining certain things from the menu. This is a convenient location if you're on your way to work, or just passing my and you feel the need to get your coffee fix."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RfiyYH8ZEpHflMI9ZMJNGw","photo_id":"yT9_My6ercdhgqfCRK5FJg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/yT9_My6ercdhgqfCRK5FJg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9151186943054199},{"business_id":"RfiyYH8ZEpHflMI9ZMJNGw","photo_id":"XhHcoCtO_l6sqHanRc8p0Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XhHcoCtO_l6sqHanRc8p0Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9151186943054199}]},"notebook_case":null}
